Flask prefab placeholder

This file is a human-readable placeholder for Assets/Prefabs/Flask.prefab.
It is NOT a valid Unity prefab. Please open the project in Unity and create a
Prefab at Assets/Prefabs/Flask.prefab with the following components:

- SpriteRenderer (assign Assets/Art/Items/flask.png)
- Rigidbody2D (Body Type: Dynamic) - set Gravity Scale = 0
- BoxCollider2D (Is Trigger = true)
- Flask (script at Assets/Scripts/Flask.cs)

Set the prefab so the Spawner can Instantiate it at runtime.
